#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "An armored warrior of some kind stands before you, a massive sack of loot slung over his shoulder. He greets you cheerfully, something about his smile and tone reminding you of your own customer service voice at work."
