msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Your purchase gives you <w>EXCLUSIVE ACCESS</w> to new features never seen in the game before!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are the features?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can I get a refund?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Microtransactions are evil!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "<w>Exclusive access</w> to the Fantastic Red Shirt!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "<w>Exclusive access</w> to the Art Book!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "<w>Exclusive access</w> to the Soundtrack!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "<w>Exclusive access</w> to Phone Backgrounds!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-0/51
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "<w>Exclusive access</w> to Lucinda Lavish!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-0/62
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "And most importantly... <w>Exclusive access</w> to me and my store, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mikey's pleasant smile falters for just a moment."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "...yeah?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "You could."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Please don't."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "You might just fall in love with me, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "But I'm not!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Despite having no visible eyelashes, Mikey manages to bat his at you all the same."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "I'm cute!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You prey upon humanity's worst tendencies."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You teach gambling to children!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You take away profits from game developers!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, you are cute."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "So does the candy industry!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Do you hate candy?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is a false equivalence."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! Candy is evil too!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh, you're right I guess."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Candy is something you pay money and get an unknown reward for!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "And if kids get rotten teeth, that's their own fault."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "They should have better parents!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Uh, all right."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Guess no candy for you..."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Unless you ever get a sweet tooth... !"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "I'll be here by your bedside."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-0/23/c-2/7 mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-2/15/c-0/16/c-0/7 mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-3/7 mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Yay! Awkwardness averted!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "It's not gambling if there's no chance of winning any money!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "And I bring <w>joy</w> to kids with my thrill of <w>random chance!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "I can assure you that the creators of this game get a certain percentage of my profits!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What percentage?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/c-2/34/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "I'm not certain."
