msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "You have very little money."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/g-2/c-13/23/c-0/39
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "But just by being at your home, Valdivian pays out its employees 5 <w>Money</w> per day as a way of saying 'Thank!'"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/g-2/c-13/23/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you mean... 'Thanks'?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/g-2/c-13/23/c-0/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes perfect sense to me!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/g-2/c-13/23/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Yeah, that!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_start/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Come by when you've saved up enough <w>Money</w> and pull me, baby!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See? Evil!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "...I'm not evil."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "I'm doing this to support my kids, if you really gotta know."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Blame it on the economic climate, housing market, whatever you want."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "But a transaction's gotta transact to survive out there..."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd rather you die."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I see where you're coming from..."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "All right, I've got thick skin."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "But enough is enough."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "I'll still let ya pull me, but we're gonna cool it for today."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-0/31
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-0/70
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "I don't get a single Money from all the microtransactions in this game."
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/seeevil/0/c-0/39/c-0/78
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "It's bullshit!"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_day_start/0/3
msgctxt "Mikey"
msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr ""

#: mikey_micro/mikey_day_start/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
