#: mikey_micro/mikey_day_start/0/c-10/18/c-2/7 mikey_micro/mikey_love_ending/0/c-0/37 mikey_micro/mikey_love_ending/0/c-1/15/c-0/37 mikey_micro/mikey_friend_ending/0/32
